{"id":"koz","name":"Koz","aliases":[],"sources":["nave","easton"],"topics":["nave:koz"],"groups":[],"definition":{"source":"easton","term":"Koz","text":"Thorn. (1.) A descendant of Judah. 1 Chr. 4:8, “Coz;” R.V., “Hakkoz.” (2.) A priest, the head of the seventh division of the priests (Ezra 2:61; Neh. 3:4, 21; 7:63). In 1 Chr. 24:10 the word has the article prefixed, and it is taken as a part of the word “Hakkoz.”"},"lemmas":[{"strong":"H6976","lemma":"קוֹץ","xlit":"Qôwts","gloss":"Kots, the name of two Israelites","kjv":"Koz, Hakkoz","count":5,"share":1},{"strong":"H1121","lemma":"בֵּן","xlit":"bên","gloss":"a son , in the widest sense , etc.)","kjv":"afflicted, age, ite, ed one","count":4,"share":0.8}],"verses":["1Chr.24.10","Ezra.2.61","Neh.3.4","Neh.3.21","Neh.7.63"],"related":[{"id":"hakkoz","type":"cooccur","shared":4,"jaccard":0.8,"why":"4 verses are indexed under both"},{"id":"hakkoz","type":"lexical","strong":"H6976","why":"both lead with קוֹץ (H6976)"},{"id":"abdon","type":"lexical","strong":"H1121","why":"both lead with בֵּן (H1121)"},{"id":"accursed","type":"lexical","strong":"H1121","why":"both lead with בֵּן (H1121)"},{"id":"achbor","type":"lexical","strong":"H1121","why":"both lead with בֵּן (H1121)"},{"id":"adaiah","type":"lexical","strong":"H1121","why":"both lead with בֵּן (H1121)"},{"id":"adrammelech","type":"lexical","strong":"H1121","why":"both lead with בֵּן (H1121)"},{"id":"aharah","type":"lexical","strong":"H1121","why":"both lead with בֵּן (H1121)"}],"works":[]}
